    "source_admission": "The reader hashes the exact driver manifest, checks the complete source Git census and harness references, hashes all inline providers, verifies candidate provider Git blob identities, and uniquely locates each referenced definition by qualified name and decorated line interval before exact AST/signature comparison.",
